  Category: 2
  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: 1f6a6789373206e498f996cb54aeedb1, type: 3}
  Interactable: {fileID: 5048261325816738630, guid: 1f6a6789373206e498f996cb54aeedb1, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - 
  - "Dear Astrid,\n\nWell, well, well. Your dad tells me that Elijah ran off. Didn\u2019t
    I tell you that boy was trouble? \n\nIt\u2019s time to come home, Astrid. This
    town needs you. I know you like astronomy, but there are more important things
    to think about. Food. Clean water. Medicine. When has looking at the stars ever
    helped anyone?  \n\nRemember, the roads are dangerous. Be alert. And see if you
    can get your hands on some antibiotics and other medsf or the clinic\u2014the
    supply chain is a mess and everything is running out.\n\nWith love,\nAunt Martha\n"
  - 
